# Insurance Automation Framework
 
## Overview
 
Python Selenium automation framework for testing an end-to-end health insurance purchase journey.
 
## Tech Stack
 
- Python
- Selenium WebDriver
- Pytest
- Page Object Model (POM)
- Git & GitHub
- Allure Reports
 
## Framework Structure
 
- `pages/` – Page Object classes
- `tests/` – Test cases and pytest fixtures
- `config/` – Configuration files
- `data/` – Test data
- `utils/` – Utilities and logging
- `reports/` – Test reports
- `screenshots/` – Failure screenshots
 
## Scenarios Automated
 
- Login
- Declaration
- User details
- Medical questionnaire
- Quote
- Share payment
- Payment gateway
- Payment success
 
## Execution
 
```bash
pytest -v
 
